e_name": "screen_2560x1440_2021-07-18_11-37-35.png", "id": "200300765366565", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75307249_200300768699898_5215046548579562888_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FtGt0NgLqp4Q7kNvwHN5E6E&_nc_oc=AdpziOB7OZtMZTByGd-1K5M1JIOD7ZE-g1GGNdyLGH6U6UpX-mnsT5CLJCU40S96CsI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrcP2J6oGWC81kW5sy58mQeO791gEzhlo1_BDSpIoZZg&oe=6B09A071"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "pdp8_2560x1440_2021-06-06_11-56-09.png", "id": "2573647642929739", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974750_2573647646263072_5000227285301093937_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lbOoy1mNoxEQ7kNvwHM-j5P&_nc_oc=AdpxwbIwWg2ftt7UrncRlXqTJ2QZHt1TDSkZDo78LRf9LXauvwkO6QQ5gCNlXj3Y6hY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTup27OJweaFF6yIzi5kF8o0-iPeyKCARcSexYxbBWWrQ&oe=6B09A4F7"}, "display_name": "Starfighter Arduxim Multiplayer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Strap into the cockpit of your starfighter and take on enemy starships in this first-person tactical space shooter. Fight as part of a team alongside your friends or in free for all battle. Features multiple game modes, ships and weapon load-outs.\n\nControl your ship using Touch controllers, a gamepad, or hand tracking. Players can use the thumb sticks on a physical controller, or for a more immersive experience grab virtual cockpit controls using the Touch controllers or your bare hands.\n\nThe multiplayer of Starfighter Arduxim is free to play and has no micro-transactions or ads.\n\nThe full version available separately includes:\n* A fourteen mission story based campaign covering your first tour of duty on the front lines\n* Practice mode\n* Survival/horde challenge mode with online leader board", "short_description": "Strap into the cockpit of your starfighter and take 